---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pokémon Pomodoro Timer | Sagun B. Pradhan"
description: "A Pomodoro focus timer in a Pokémon battle: a wild Pokémon's HP drains as you focus, and Nurse Chansey heals your team during breaks."
nav: pomodoro
css: [ "/assets/css/case-study.css", "/assets/css/pomodoro.css" ]
scripts: [ "/assets/js/pomodoro.js" ]
---
  <header class="cs-hero pomo-hero">
    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Focus tool</p>
      <h1>Pokémon Pomodoro</h1>
      <p class="cs-hero__lede">
        Focus for 25 minutes while a wild Pokémon's HP drains. When it faints, you catch it
        and take a break at the Pokémon Center. Every fourth catch earns a longer rest.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="stripes" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="s1"></span>
    <span class="s2"></span>
    <span class="s3"></span>
    <span class="s4"></span>
  </div>

  <main id="content" class="cs-body">
    <div class="shell">

      <section class="pomo" data-pomodoro aria-label="Pomodoro timer">

        <div class="pomo__scene">
          <div class="pomo__hud">
            <p class="pomo__top"><span class="pomo__name">…</span><span class="pomo__lv">Lv<b>25</b></span></p>
            <p class="pomo__hp"><span class="pomo__hp-label">HP</span><span class="pomo__track" role="progressbar" aria-label="Time left" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100"><span class="pomo__fill"></span></span></p>
            <p class="pomo__time" aria-hidden="true">25:00</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pomo__foe"><img class="pomo__sprite" width="96" height="96" alt=""></div>

          <div class="pomo__trainer">
            <span class="pokeball" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="pomo__party" aria-label="Sessions this round"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pomo__panel">
          <p class="pomo__dialog" aria-live="polite">…</p>
          <div class="pomo__menu" role="group" aria-label="Timer controls">
            <button type="button" class="pomo__btn" data-act="toggle">FIGHT</button>
            <button type="button" class="pomo__btn" data-act="bag" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pomo-bag">BAG</button>
            <button type="button" class="pomo__btn" data-act="skip">SKIP</button>
            <button type="button" class="pomo__btn" data-act="reset">RUN</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <form class="pomo__bag" id="pomo-bag" hidden>
          <p class="pomo__bag-title">BAG · Timer settings</p>
          <label>Focus <input type="number" name="focus" min="1" max="120" value="25"> min</label>
          <label>Short break <input type="number" name="short" min="1" max="60" value="5"> min</label>
          <label>Long break <input type="number" name="long" min="1" max="60" value="15"> min</label>
          <label class="pomo__check"><input type="checkbox" name="sound" checked> Sound</label>
          <p class="pomo__hint">Keys: <kbd>Space</kbd> fight / pause · <kbd>S</kbd> skip · <kbd>R</kbd> run (reset)</p>
        </form>

        <div class="pomo__caught">
          <p class="pomo__caught-title">Caught today: <b class="pomo__count">0</b></p>
          <ul class="pomo__box" aria-label="Pokémon caught today"></ul>
          <button type="button" class="pomo__clear" data-act="clear">Release all</button>
        </div>

      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
